"help.title" = "KeystrokeQR Host Help";
"help.quickstart.title" = "Quick start";
"help.quickstart.body" = "KeystrokeQR Host runs quietly in the menu bar — no window needed. Pair your iPhone once with the on-screen code, then scan any QR or barcode in the KeystrokeQR app: this Mac types the text into whatever field is focused. Typing needs Accessibility permission (see the panel). For long text or slow/remote input fields, lower the Typing speed so nothing gets dropped.";
"help.troubleshooting.title" = "Troubleshooting";
"help.trouble.notFound.title" = "iPhone can't find this Mac";
"help.trouble.notFound.body" = "Make sure both devices are on the same Wi-Fi network. Check that a firewall or VPN isn't blocking the local network, and allow the local-network prompt on macOS if it appears.";
